Provenance of files in this directory
=====================================

These fixtures validate combinr's assembler (Algorithm 1) against PASA.

  pasa_cpp_sample_input*          Sample inputs in PASA's C++ `pasa` token
                                  format (including the `_minusFL` variants).
  pasa_cpp_sample_input*.golden   The corresponding output of the original PASA
                                  C++ `pasa` binary, committed as a frozen
                                  reference.

Derived from PASA (PASApipeline):
  https://github.com/PASApipeline/PASApipeline

